{"seq":2,"slug":"development-economics-grad","title":"发展经济学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/graduate/economics/development-economics-grad","introMarkdown":"# 发展经济学 简介\n\n发展经济学研究低收入和中等收入国家的经济增长、贫困消除和社会发展问题。作为一个兼具理论深度和政策相关性的学科领域，发展经济学在近二十年经历了方法论革命，实证识别和因果推断日益成为研究的核心范式。\n\n本课程从经济增长的理论模型出发，经由贫困与不平等的测量分析和政策评估方法论，最终延伸至气候、数字化和移民等前沿议题，共设四个章节。\n\n第一章**经济增长理论**梳理解释国家间收入差距的主要理论框架。新古典增长模型建立了资本积累和技术进步驱动增长的基本逻辑，内生增长理论将创新内生化为经济系统的核心动力，制度经济学则强调产权保护和治理质量对长期增长的决定性作用。\n\n第二章**贫困与不平等**深入分析发展中国家面临的核心挑战。贫困测量的多维化方法论、收入不平等的动态演化机制以及社会流动性与代际传递的实证研究，构成了理解发展问题的微观基础。\n\n第三章**发展政策评估**聚焦于如何严格评估发展干预的因果效果。随机对照试验方法、准实验的影响评估设计以及成本效益分析框架，为政策制定者和研究者提供了从证据到决策的系统路径。\n\n第四章**前沿专题**追踪发展经济学中最活跃的研究方向。气候变化对发展中国家的不对称冲击、数字技术在缩小或加剧数字鸿沟中的双重角色、以及国际移民的发展效应，展示了这一学科不断演进的研究前沿。\n\n建议学习者结合发展中国家的真实案例阅读各章内容，在理论与经验之间建立紧密联系。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"growth-theory","title":"经济增长理论","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/economics/development-economics-grad/growth-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"neoclassical-growth","title":"研究生 发展经济学 — 新古典增长模型","url":"/education/graduate/economics/development-economics-grad/growth-theory/neoclassical-growth"},{"seq":2,"slug":"endogenous-growth","title":"研究生 发展经济学 — 内生增长理论","url":"/education/graduate/economics/development-economics-grad/growth-theory/endogenous-growth"},{"seq":3,"slug":"institutions-growth","title":"研究生 发展经济学 — 制度与增长","url":"/education/graduate/economics/development-economics-grad/growth-theory/institutions-growth"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"poverty-inequality","title":"贫困与不平等","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/economics/development-economics-grad/poverty-inequality","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"poverty-measurement","title":"研究生 发展经济学 — 贫困测量与诊断","url":"/education/graduate/economics/development-economics-grad/poverty-inequality/poverty-measurement"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inequality-dynamics","title":"研究生 发展经济学 — 不平等的动态演化","url":"/education/graduate/economics/development-economics-grad/poverty-inequality/inequality-dynamics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"social-mobility","title":"研究生 发展经济学 — 社会流动性与代际传递","url":"/education/graduate/economics/development-economics-grad/poverty-inequality/social-mobility"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"policy-evaluation","title":"发展政策评估","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/economics/development-economics-grad/policy-evaluation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rct-methods","title":"研究生 发展经济学 — 随机对照试验方法","url":"/education/graduate/economics/development-economics-grad/policy-evaluation/rct-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"impact-evaluation","title":"研究生 发展经济学 — 影响评估方法","url":"/education/graduate/economics/development-economics-grad/policy-evaluation/impact-evaluation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-benefit-analysis","title":"研究生 发展经济学 — 成本效益分析","url":"/education/graduate/economics/development-economics-grad/policy-evaluation/cost-benefit-analysis"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"frontier-topics","title":"前沿专题","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/economics/development-economics-grad/frontier-topics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"climate-development","title":"研究生 发展经济学 — 气候与发展","url":"/education/graduate/economics/development-economics-grad/frontier-topics/climate-development"},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-divide","title":"研究生 发展经济学 — 数字鸿沟与数字化发展","url":"/education/graduate/economics/development-economics-grad/frontier-topics/digital-divide"},{"seq":3,"slug":"migration-development","title":"研究生 发展经济学 — 移民与发展","url":"/education/graduate/economics/development-economics-grad/frontier-topics/migration-development"}]}]}